"id":"a2492d6cbc4d58f115406ca14e5ec7b6"}]', '["Miles","AXL","Attack - eXploration - Logistics","A-X-L - O Cão Robô","A-X-L","A-X-L Chú Chó Robot","機動戰犬","机器猛犬","机械猛犬"]', 1784690324391);
